  data: {
    LLM: "Keep your 'Loaders' safe. If you have the Ace of Diamonds, lead it early while everyone still has Diamonds. This ensures you 'dump' it without winning a trick filled with other Tens or Aces.\n\nThe Trump Memory: Since the trump suit is shown only once and then hidden, many players will forget it. If Spades were shown, lead Spades even if you have only the 2â€”you might catch an opponent 'trumping' with a Diamond because they forgot the rule.\n\nThe Charge: If you already have 25 points, and you know an opponent is at 28, try to win the next trick with as many point-cards as possible. If you can push them to 31 before you hit it, they lose the life.",
    Player: "Keep your 'Loaders' safe. If you have the Ace of Diamonds, lead it early while everyone still has Diamonds. This ensures you 'dump' it without winning a trick filled with other Tens or Aces.\n\nThe Trump Memory: Since the trump suit is shown only once and then hidden, many players will forget it. If Spades were shown, lead Spades even if you have only the 2â€”you might catch an opponent 'trumping' with a Diamond because they forgot the rule.\n\nThe Charge: If you already have 25 points, and you know an opponent is at 28, try to win the next trick with as many point-cards as possible. If you can push them to 31 before you hit it, they lose the life.",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
