    basic: "Keep your 'Loaders' safe. If you have the Ace of Diamonds, lead it early while everyone still has Diamonds. This ensures you 'dump' it without winning a trick filled with other Tens or Aces.",
    intermediate: "The Trump Memory: Since the trump suit is shown only once and then hidden, many players will forget it. If Spades were shown, lead Spades even if you have only the 2â€”you might catch an opponent 'trumping' with a Diamond because they forgot the rule.",
    advanced: 'The Charge: If you already have 25 points, and you know an opponent is at 28, try to win the next trick with as many point-cards as possible. If you can push them to 31 before you hit it, they lose the life.',
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Never accept an 'Exchange' offer (Coat/Card) unless you are holding a card of the same suit that you want to dump. It's a risk that usually benefits the proposer.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "The 10 is the 'stealth' loader. Most players focus on Aces, but two 10s will put you two-thirds of the way to 31 points.",
